y.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox vcard\"><caption class=\"infobox-title fn org\">Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image logo\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:IEEE_logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/IEEE_logo.svg/250px-IEEE_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/IEEE_logo.svg/500px-IEEE_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"233\" data-file-height=\"131\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Abbreviation</th><td class=\"infobox-data nickname\">IEEE</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Founded</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">January&#160;1, 1963<span class=\"noprint\">&#59;&#32;63 years ago</span><span style=\"display:none\">&#160;(<span class=\"bday dtstart published updated\">1963-01-01</span>)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Type</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Professional_association\" title=\"Professional association\">Professional association</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/Taxpayer_Identification_Number\" title=\"Taxpayer Identification Number\">Tax ID no.</a></span></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">13-1656633<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Legal&#160;status</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/501(c)(3)_organization\" title=\"501(c)(3) organization\">501(c)(3)</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Public_charity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Public charity\">public charity</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Location</th><td class=\"infobox-data label\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1126788409\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"plainlist\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/3_Park_Avenue\" title=\"3 Park Avenue\">3 Park Avenue</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/New_York_City\" title=\"New York City\">New York City</a>, U.S.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Origins</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Merger of the <a href=\"/wiki/American_Institute_of_Electrical_Engineers\" title=\"American Institute of Electrical Engineers\">American Institute of Electrical Engineers</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Institute_of_Radio_Engineers\" title=\"Institute of Radio Engineers\">Institute of Radio Engineers</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Method</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Industry standards, <a href=\"/wiki/IEEE_conferences\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IEEE conferences\">conferences</a>, publications</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Members</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">&gt;486,000</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">Key people</div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mary_Ellen_Randall\" title=\"Mary Ellen Randall\">Mary Ellen Randall</a> (President)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Revenue</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">US$646.4 million (2024)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-right:0.6em;\">Website</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"official-website\"><span class=\"url\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ieee.org/\">www<wbr />.ieee<wbr />.org</a></span></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q131566#P856\" title=\"Edit this at Wikidata\"><img alt=\"Edit this at Wikidata\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers</b> (<b>IEEE</b>)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>note 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> is an American <a href=\"/wiki/501(c)(3)_organization\" title=\"501(c)(3) organization\">501(c)(3)</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Public_charity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Public charity\">charitable</a> professional organization for <a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_engineering\" title=\"Electrical engineering\">electrical engineering</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Electronics_engineering\" title=\"Electronics engineering\">electronics engineering</a>, and related disciplines.\n</p><p>The IEEE has a corporate office in <a href=\"/wiki/New_York_City\" title=\"New York City\">New York City</a> and an operations center in <a href=\"/wiki/Piscataway,_New_Jersey\" title=\"Piscataway, New Jersey\">Piscataway, New Jersey</a>. The IEEE was formed in 1963 as an amalgamation of the <a href=\"/wiki/American_Institute_of_Electrical_Engineers\" title=\"American Institute of Electrical Engineers\">American Institute of Electrical Engineers</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Institute_of_Radio_Engineers\" title=\"Institute of Radio Engineers\">Institute of Radio Engineers</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-limited.id-lock-limited a,.mw-parser-o